 'date': '2022-01-31 07:07:00', 'title': "INTRODUCING DOMINO'S® CARRYOUT TIPS: BECAUSE YOU EARNED IT", 'text': "ANN ARBOR, MICH., JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINO'S PIZZA INC. (NYSE: DPZ) BELIEVES EVERY GREAT DELIVERY DRIVER DESERVES A TIP."}{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2022-01-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'MARY DRAVES TO RETIRE FROM DOW; ANDRE ARGENTON NAMED VICE PRESIDENT, EH&S, AND CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER', 'text': 'MIDLAND, MICH., JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOW\xa0(NYSE: DOW) TODAY ANNOUNCES THAT MARY DRAVES, VICE PRESIDENT OF ENVIRONMENT, HEALTH AND SAFETY (EH&S) AND CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER, HAS ANNOUNCED HER DECISION TO RETIRE IN APRIL 2022, FOLLOWING MORE THAN 32 YEARS OF SERVICE WITH DOW.'}{'symbol': 'EA', 'date': '2022-01-31 16:05:00', 'title': 'ELECTRONIC ARTS NAMES CHRIS SUH AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ELECTRONIC ARTS INC. TODAY NAMED CHRIS SUH THE COMPANY'S NEW CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, EFFECTIVE MARCH 1."}{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-01-31 19:30:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX TO ACQUIRE EFFICIENT HIRE', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE EFFICIENT HIRE, A PROVIDER OF CLOUD RECRUITING, ONBOARDING AND HR MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS. THIS ACQUISITION WILL ENABLE EQUIFAX WORKFORCE SOLUTIONS TO BRING EMPLOYERS MORE OF THE SERVICES AND INSIGHTS THEY NEED TO HELP THEM MANAGE AMIDST A RAPIDLY CHANGING HIRING AND EMPLOYMENT LANDSCAPE.'}{'symbol': 'EXR', 'date': '2022-01-31 18:02:00', 'title': 'EXTRA SPACE STORAGE JOINS CEO ACTION FOR DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY, JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EXTRA SPACE STORAGE (NYSE: EXR) CEO JOE MARGOLIS OFFICIALLY JOINED THE CEO ACTION FOR DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION AND TOOK THE CEO PLEDGE. CEO ACTION FOR DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION IS A GROUP STARTED BY CEOS TO RALLY THE BUSINESS COMMUNITY TO ADVANCE DIVERSITY AND INCLUSION IN THE WORKPLACE.'}{'symbol': 'XO